      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GANGSTER GORT (4) is rarely out of the finish, recording 10 places from 20 starts. Finished in the minors latest when second (22.82) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Has never missed the frame here from three starts. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading chance again. SAMARA ROSE (8) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (22.79) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Should be in this for a long way. KEYS A KRACKEN (6) is long overdue for a win and in super consistent form, jumping from this box to place last time at this track (23.19), making it five straight minors. Must include in calculations. BLACK DAZZLER (1) busted the clock to salute last start. Must be respected.",
